In order to be effective leaders in today's competitive world, it is necessary for me as the World's Ruler to:
1. Make people happier with work;
2. Keep their homes and jobs well stocked with groceries so they have no need to seek out food from a restaurant;
3. Ensure that our citizens spend more than we receive to fund education (education is now an investment that can only get larger over time if sustained enough);
4. Encourage healthy choices for everyone; i.e. encourage them to stop smoking or consume cigarettes, which costs money but provides life quality benefits;
5. Educate citizens about the consequences of their actions, including their children, who will grow up with the same set of values regardless of parents' lifestyle, thus creating a stable society with less conflict between generations and therefore lower rates of global conflicts such as wars and political upheavals;
6. Encourage and support businesses which operate profitably to ensure employment and wealth distribution across all countries and peoples
7. Increase tax revenue and use this revenue to fund international development programs such as UN peacekeeping missions, humanitarian aid projects, disaster recovery, etc.
8. Increase infrastructure spending on health care, education, roads, housing, ports and airports etc., to improve citizen satisfaction and overall living
